# Salt versus sugar freezing race
# Expectation: At equal 0.02 mol doses in 100 g water, NaCl should depress freezing roughly twice as much as sucrose. Both should form ice after 15 kJ cooling from 5 C.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g @ 5C
add v1 NaCl 0.02mol
new
add v2 water 100g @ 5C
add v2 C12H22O11 0.02mol
cool v1 15kJ
cool v2 15kJ
inspect
